('hangang-neon-hangul-bream','fish','네온한글도미','밤물이 짙어지면 비늘 사이의 한글 자모가 네온처럼 빛나요.','0.2','0.78','0.02',78,'rare','fish/rare/hangang-neon-hangul-bream_v1_thumbnail.png',330,'fish/rare/hangang-neon-hangul-bream_v1_sprite.png','hangang','swim',true,'right'),
