('hangang-talchum-puffer','fish','탈춤복어','하회탈 같은 미소를 짓고 색동 리본을 흔들며 물속 탈춤을 추어요.','0.2','0.78','0.02',78,'rare','fish/rare/hangang-talchum-puffer_v1_thumbnail.png',300,'fish/rare/hangang-talchum-puffer_v1_sprite.png','hangang','swim',true,'right'),
